the door at the dark end of the hall"}}}],"turn":17,"quests":[{"id":"closeness","title":"Closeness","reward":"PRESENCE +1","status":"complete","objective":"close the distance between you"},{"id":"kiss","title":"The Kiss","reward":"WILL +1","status":"complete","objective":"kiss her"},{"id":"night","title":"The Night","reward":"VITALITY +1","status":"complete","objective":"take her to bed"},{"id":"full","title":"Fully Hers","reward":"THE LINK — first activation","status":"complete","objective":"give yourself to her fully"},{"id":"floor-1-door","title":"The Shut Door","status":"active","objective":"open the door at the dark end of the hall"}],"chapters":[],"revealed":{"kind":"player","name":"Alan","bonds":[{"name":"Aria","note":"+1 PRESENCE from her — grows as hers grows.","value":1}],"class":"None","level":1,"skills":[],"titles":[],"equipment":{},"inventory":[],"affinities":[],"attributes":{"LUCK":10,"WILL":17,"MIGHT":11,"FINESSE":13,"PRESENCE":16,"VITALITY":7,"INTELLECT":18,"PERCEPTION":11}}},"progress":593,"completed-at":"2026-07-13T21:42:40.986Z","lore-ingested-at":"2026-07-14T06:39:42.648Z","id":"f9b23b75-2b50-538e-a0d3-0dc038f979a1"}
-{"external-id":"turn-19","turn-number":19,"status":"published","text":"It is stranger than the fight, the quiet that comes after. You stand on the new floor with the knife still in your hand and the wall sealed smooth where a door of dead plaster had been, and the tiredness hits you all at once. \"We should stop,\" you say. The words come out rough. \"Both of us. That was — we need a break after that.\" Aria does not argue. She looks at you a moment, the knowing brightness of her banked low for once, and inclines her head.\n\nBut first you look. You have learned this floor's older sibling well enough to know the shape of the place — the hall running to its dark far end, and nearer, where you stand, the doors of rooms. You try them. This is the lived-in end: a suite that is somehow yours, made up as though it had been waiting on you, and past it a smaller room lit silver-grey that must be hers. You go through both as a man goes through his pockets one more time, thorough and without much hope. A bed, a basin, a lamp, linens folded by hands you never saw. Nothing with an edge to it, nothing that answers to weapon or key. The floor keeps its useful things behind its doors, you are starting to see, and pays them out only to those who get through — and here at the top of the climb there is only the ordinary furniture of rest.\n\nSo you set the knife on the table by the bed, where the morning will find it, and you let the day come to its end. Whatever the fight took out of you, the rest gives back; you feel it as you lie down, the deep ache going quiet by degrees, the body remembering how to be whole, the floor holding you like solid ground under a man who has finally stopped falling. Aria is there in the low light, near, the warmth of her a fixed point in a place with none of its own. Neither of you reaches for more than this tonight; the fight is too close behind, and the rest of it can keep. But the two of you went into a wall of moving plaster together and came out the other side, and the thread that runs between you lies a little nearer the surface than it did this morning, close enough to feel if you turn toward it. \"Sleep,\" she says, in the old low voice, the one that turns a plain word into a whole hand laid flat on your chest. \"The dungeon will still be there in the morning. It is very good at waiting.\" And at the dark end of the hall, the new door waits with it.\n","length":467,"published-at":"2026-07-13T22:27:22.822Z","word-count":467,"draft-author":"019f5863-3da8-7d69-aa7c-0c92cddd9b5b","sheet-snapshot":{"hud":{"level":2,"pools":{"mana":108,"health":80,"manaMax":108,"stamina":70,"healthMax":104,"staminaMax":70}},"log":[{"id":"hh-t1-soul-appraisal","turn":1,"type":"system","window":{"type":"status-assessment","assessment":{"name":"Alan","class":"None","level":1,"pools":{"mana":104,"health":70,"manaMax":104,"stamina":50,"healthMax":70,"staminaMax":50},"attributes":{"LUCK":10,"WILL":16,"MIGHT":11,"FINESSE":13,"PRESENCE":15,"VITALITY":6,"INTELLECT":18,"PERCEPTION":11}}}},{"id":"hh-t5-quest","turn":5,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-offer","quest":{"title":"Closeness","objective":"close the distance between you."}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-closeness","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"closeness","title":"Closeness","reward":"PRESENCE +1","objective":"close the distance between you"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-kiss","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"kiss","title":"The Kiss","reward":"WILL +1","objective":"kiss her"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-night-offer","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-offer","quest":{"id":"night","title":"The Night","objective":"take her to bed"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-night","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"night","title":"The Night","reward":"VITALITY +1","objective":"take her to bed"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-full","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"full","title":"Fully Hers","reward":"THE LINK — first activation","objective":"give yourself to her fully"}}},{"id":"hh-t11-link-alan-pick","turn":11,"type":"system","window":{"type":"system-choice","choice":{"id":"hh-t11-link-alan-pick","title":"THE LINK","prompt":"Bind one of Aria's skills or attributes to yourself. The bound trait rises as its source rises.","options":[{"id":"read-the-table","label":"Read the Table","detail":"Her read on the true state of a room — who holds what, where the tension actually sits, what the next beat wants."},{"id":"set-the-pace","label":"Set the Pace","detail":"Her command of an exchange's tempo — slowing a rushed moment, holding a beat, quickening a stall."},{"id":"presence","label":"Presence","detail":"The plain force of her — the way a room, or a night, arranges itself around her without her seeming to ask."}],"selectedOptionId":"presence"}}},{"id":"hh-t12-link-bound","turn":12,"type":"system","window":{"type":"talent-activation","activation":{"note":"Presence (hers) bound to you. Will (yours) bound to her. A bound trait rises as its source rises.","holder":"Alan","status":"bound","talent":"THE LINK"}}},{"id":"hh-t12-door-quest","turn":12,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-offer","quest":{"id":"floor-1-door","title":"The Shut Door","objective":"open the door at the dark end of the hall"}}},{"id":"hh-t18-q-floor1","turn":18,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"floor-1-door","title":"The Shut Door","objective":"open the door at the dark end of the hall"}}}],"turn":18,"quests":[{"id":"closeness","title":"Closeness","reward":"PRESENCE +1","status":"complete","objective":"close the distance between you"},{"id":"kiss","title":"The Kiss","reward":"WILL +1","status":"complete","objective":"kiss her"},{"id":"night","title":"The Night","reward":"VITALITY +1","status":"complete","objective":"take her to bed"},{"id":"full","title":"Fully Hers","reward":"THE LINK — first activation","status":"complete","objective":"give yourself to her fully"},{"id":"floor-1-door","title":"The Shut Door","status":"complete","objective":"open the door at the dark end of the hall"},{"id":"floor-2-door","title":"The Far Door","status":"active","objective":"reach the shut door at the dark end of the second floor"}],"chapters":[],"revealed":{"kind":"player","name":"Alan","bonds":[{"name":"Aria","note":"+1 PRESENCE from her — grows as hers grows.","value":1}],"class":"None","level":2,"skills":[],"titles":[],"equipment":{"weapon":{"name":"Letter-Knife"}},"inventory":[],"affinities":[],"attributes":{"LUCK":11,"WILL":18,"MIGHT":12,"FINESSE":15,"PRESENCE":16,"VITALITY":10,"INTELLECT":18,"PERCEPTION":12}}},"progress":467,"completed-at":"2026-07-13T22:21:29.245Z","lore-ingested-at":"2026-07-13T22:36:42.908Z","id":"b8b0c038-42ca-5685-aa9e-47db10bfaa49"}
-{"external-id":"turn-20","turn-number":20,"status":"published","text":"You come up out of sleep all at once and whole, as you have not woken since this place took you — no ache, no ghost of the fight in your shoulder. The lamp has burned down to nothing. Aria is a warm weight along your side, awake, watching you surface with the small pleased look of a thing gone as she would have written it. You roll into her, over her, your mouth finding the line of her jaw. \"Fuck for luck,\" you say against her skin, \"before the next door?\"\n\nShe laughs low in her throat, the sound of it moving through you where you are pressed against her. \"Luck,\" she says, tasting the word as if deciding whether to let you have it. Her hand comes up into your hair, taking its time. \"I have no luck to give you, you know. It is not a thing I deal in — no one does; the dice fall where they fall, and I would be lying if I told you my hands could tip them. But this, I will take gladly, and for its own sake, and not because it buys you anything at that door. Come here.\"\n\nAnd you do. It is not the careful, astonished thing the first night was; you know each other now, the map of it, what she likes and how she likes to be made to wait for it. She sets the pace — slow where she wants you slow, her mouth curved against yours all the while like she is telling you a story and this is only the part before the good part. You lose the door. You lose the floor and the dungeon and the whole climbing weight of the place; there is only the full weight of her over you, the low sounds she does not trouble to hide, the give and grip of her, and her voice still at your ear — \"more patience than that; we have all morning\" — until neither of you has patience left for anything, and the morning takes you both.\n\nAfter, you lie in the tangle of the linens, the risen light grey and plain across the room, the two of you gone loose and quiet. She is the first to move — of course she is. She rises and gathers herself back into the shape the day wants, silver and composed, only the smallest disorder left in her hair to admit the morning happened at all. She hands you your shirt. \"No luckier than you were,\" she says, \"but better company for the walk.\" You could not have looked at the far end of the hall last night without something in you flinching from it. This morning, you find you can. You dress. You take up the knife. You go to see what the second floor has grown to stop you.\n","length":481,"published-at":"2026-07-14T10:11:09.346Z","word-count":481,"draft-author":"019f5863-3da8-7d69-aa7c-0c92cddd9b5b","sheet-snapshot":{"hud":{"level":2,"pools":{"mana":108,"health":104,"manaMax":108,"stamina":70,"healthMax":104,"staminaMax":70}},"log":[{"id":"hh-t1-soul-appraisal","turn":1,"type":"system","window":{"type":"status-assessment","assessment":{"name":"Alan","class":"None","level":1,"pools":{"mana":104,"health":70,"manaMax":104,"stamina":50,"healthMax":70,"staminaMax":50},"attributes":{"LUCK":10,"WILL":16,"MIGHT":11,"FINESSE":13,"PRESENCE":15,"VITALITY":6,"INTELLECT":18,"PERCEPTION":11}}}},{"id":"hh-t5-quest","turn":5,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-offer","quest":{"title":"Closeness","objective":"close the distance between you."}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-closeness","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"closeness","title":"Closeness","reward":"PRESENCE +1","objective":"close the distance between you"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-kiss","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"kiss","title":"The Kiss","reward":"WILL +1","objective":"kiss her"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-night-offer","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-offer","quest":{"id":"night","title":"The Night","objective":"take her to bed"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-night","turn":10,"type":"system","window":{"type":"quest-complete","quest":{"id":"night","title":"The Night","reward":"VITALITY +1","objective":"take her to bed"}}},{"id":"hh-t10-q-full","turn":10,"