+        "THE ENDLESS, UNKNOWN FRAME: the Hotel is endless as far as anyone has ever gone; its purpose, its operator, and how Alan arrived are UNKNOWN — he woke with no memory of arriving. This is the governing condition, never explained. The place behaves as if it has a logic not-yet-seen; the mystery lives in that behavior, never in System commentary (the System is mute).",
