+    {
+      "id": "invisible-turns:boundary-seam",
+      "title": "Invisible turns — boundary seam: no recap-to-start or wind-down-to-end scaffolding at the turn's edges; the turn opens and closes mid-fiction."
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "invisible-turns:invitation-close",
+      "title": "Invisible turns — invitation/handoff close: the turn does not end on a narrator-voice solicitation of the next input ('what do you do?', 'the floor is yours')."
